{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212110","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1421211001:1":{"text":"Using normal methods won't work. Feli must've added a little something special to it.","source_cn":"看来一般的方法并不适用，斐利尔应该又添加了自己的奇思妙想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A0FE7F72711CD78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421211002:1":{"text":"Yes, Master Feli was always like this. He liked adding a little magic to everything he touched.","source_cn":"斐利尔大人总是这样，会把普通的东西变得神奇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23AECAF53FC4B372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421211003:1":{"text":"That's him, alright. He pulled a lot of harmless pranks on people.","source_cn":"这就是他，喜欢搞些奇怪但又……可爱的小把戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2887013D2D8CF80F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421211004:1":{"text":"Master Feli was clearly a very powerful priest, but he always had a lot of fairy tale ideas.","source_cn":"没错！斐利尔大人明明是很厉害的祭司，却总是想一些……像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC31B377C26EE2CE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421211005:1":{"text":"Once at the Lunaris Altar, he turned some decorative flowers into beau